== policy-claude-keychain: security find-generic-password (metadata only)
rc=1
/bin/sh: /tmp/err.txt: Operation not permitted
  mxc-spike: '/bin/sh' '-c' 'security find-generic-password -a "$(id -un)" -s "Claude Code-credentials" >/dev/null; echo "rc=$?"'
  rc=44
  security: SecKeychainSearchCopyNext: The specified item could not be found in the keychain.
== policy-claude: security find-generic-password (metadata only)
rc=1
/bin/sh: /tmp/err.txt: Operation not permitted
  mxc-spike: '/bin/sh' '-c' 'security find-generic-password -a "$(id -un)" -s "Claude Code-credentials" >/dev/null; echo "rc=$?"'
  rc=44
  security: SecKeychainSearchCreateFromAttributes: One or more parameters passed to a function were not valid.
  security: SecKeychainSearchCopyNext: The specified item could not be found in the keychain.
